  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;then <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> {using graph}<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/cf48b4f7-5d46-48cf-9899-a451f3f99b1c.png\" style=\"width:2.37361in;height:1.91319in\" /><br />For given inequality, we must have <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi></math><br />Possible integral values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> are <math><mn>0,3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6,7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>",
